# Per-checkout sync state, not project source. All three are written by the
# sync tooling and address entities in one specific org and project, so a
# committed copy would point every checkout at ours. A fresh checkout has no
# baseline — establish one against your own project with an explicit
# --org/--project on the first pull.
.metabind/state.json
metabind.resolved

# Secrets are KMS-encrypted server-side and never sync. Never commit.
.metabind/secrets.json

.DS_Store
node_modules/
